
/**
\page lua_api_joypad Joypad

\tableofcontents

\section lua_api_joypad_overview Overview


The \c sol.joypad type provides an abstraction over the plugged joypads, it uses SDL's [`gamecontroller`](https://wiki.libsdl.org/CategoryGameController) API to
map any compatible joypad to standard buttons resembling those of the Xbox.

Joypad instances can be fetched using the `sol.input` module.

\section lua_api_joypad_axis_buttons Axes and buttons names

- buttons: `a`, `b`, `x`, `y`, `back`, `guide`, `start`, `left_stick`, `right_stick`, `left_shoulder`, `right_shoulder`, `dpad_up`, `dpad_down`, `dpad_left`, `dpad_right`
- axes: `left_x`, `left_y`, `right_x`, `right_y`, `trigger_left`, `trigger_right`

\section lua_api_joypad_methods Methods of the type joypad

\subsection lua_api_joypad_get_name joypad:get_name()

Returns the name of this joypad.

\subsection lua_api_joypad_has_rumble joypad:has_rumble()

Tells whether this joypad has rumble support.

\subsection lua_api_joypad_rumble joypad:rumble(intensity, duration)

- \c intensity (number): intensity of the rumble (0->1)
- \c duration (number): duration of the rumble in milliseconds

\subsection lua_api_joypad_get_axis joypad:get_axis(axis)

- \c axis (string): axis name, see \ref lua_api_joypad_axis_buttons

Returns the value of a joypad axis (-1 -> 1) 

\subsection lua_api_joypad_is_button_pressed joypad:is_button_pressed(button)

- \c button (string): button name, see \ref lua_api_joypad_axis_buttons

Returns true if the button is pressed. 

\subsection lua_api_joypad_is_attached joypad:is_attached()

Returns true if the joypad is still attached. 

\section lua_api_joypad_events Events of the type joypad

\subsection lua_api_joypad_on_button_pressed joypad:on_button_pressed(button)

Called when a button of this joypad is pressed.

- \c button (string): name of the pressed button

\subsection lua_api_joypad_on_button_released joypad:on_button_released(button)

Called when a button of this joypad is released.

- \c button (string): name of the released button

\subsection lua_api_joypad_on_axis_moved joypad:on_axis_moved(axis, value)

Called when a axis of this joypad moves.

- \c axis (string): name of the axis
- \c value (number): new value of the axis

\subsection lua_api_joypad_on_removed joypad:on_removed()

Called when a the joypad is removed.

*/
